Changes to sing-box v1.14.4 (GNU GPL v3.0 or later), made by the unbraid authors, last on 2026-10-22:
the engine asks the network's IPv4 DNS servers before its IPv6 ones, so a lookup isn't spent waiting on an
IPv6 server that doesn't answer.
Applied by tools/build-libbox.sh; git apply skips these lines.

